    88	`t=2..7`, and on `tau_t=T_(t,0)-T_(t,0)(0)`, weight `4t+1`, with the constant
    89	`T_(t,0)(0)=yg` a unit).  Lemma CHAIN (banked) makes `dim I_(t,+)=0` the chain
    90	`(C0),(C2..C_(t-1)),(Cb)`; the tail is proved on the sub-charts; `(C0)` is
