   658	```text
   659	tau_t in sqrt(I_{t,+})
   660	```
   661	
   662	over characteristic zero.  It is proved for `t=2` on both fibres and for
   663	`t=3..7`; at `t=8`, `b4=0` is proved and `b4=1` is still open after an
   664	1800-second foreground run.  No uniform power/cofactor certificate was found.
