+### 2.3 Support and leading-coefficient tables
+
+Let
+
+\[
+ p_{t-1}(n)=[z^n]\prod_{j=1}^{t-1}(1-z^j)^{-1}.                         \tag{2.3}
+\]
+
+The support of every requested form is the complete set of monomials of its
+weight.  The exact counts are:
