+A chart-safe homogeneous formulation is useful for future work.  With kernel
+coordinate \([u:v]\), impose
+
+\[
+ uC_r+vB_r=0,\qquad
+ \widehat Q_t=a_0v^2+b_0uv+c_0u^2.                                    \tag{4.11}
+\]
