+In the charged `wp(1,2,...,t-1)` order with \(b_4\) dominant, full support and
+\(\lambda_F\ne0\) imply
+
+\[
+ \operatorname{LT}(F)=\lambda_F(t,r)b_4^w.                              \tag{2.5}
+\]
