+ T_{3,5}=a_0b_3^2+b_0b_3+c_0,
+ \qquad a_0={-575d-340\over17248},                                     \tag{2.2}
+\]
+
+and the complete \(b_0,c_0\) are the `b_0` and `c_0` assignments in the first
