+ \lambda_{C}(t,r)=a_0\lambda_c(t,r)-lambda_a(t,r)\lambda_c(t,0).        \tag{3.23}
+\]
+
+Thus the leading coefficients are functions of \((t,r)\) given by the same
+finite path sum.  The exact specializations through \(t=6\) are tabulated in
+the box.  No fixed rational function in \(\mathbf Q(t,d)\) is asserted for the
+growing-depth sequences in (3.23).
