    39	                sqrt(I_2(N)+(W_1,...,W_(t-1))) = m
    40	              factorwise; for the Q-only clause, saturate away the rank-zero
    41	              ideal.  If clause (i) is supplied, the two tests are equivalent.
    42	              It is never “W_1 is a unit” or “gcd(W_r) is a unit.”
    43	
    44	CONTROL       At t=2 the same formulas give the y=1/5 b3-axis failure and the
    45	              y=2/5 zero-dimensional/nonvanishing fibre exactly.
    46	
    47	FINAL STATUS  OPEN[K16-Q-NONVANISHING-ON-GAMMA] is NOT RESOLVED.
    48	              Verdict: PARTIAL, with the coefficient generating form derived
    49	              and the exact residual/global-chart correction recorded below.
    50	```
