+Its norm has the sole admissible boundary zero \(t=2\), so (1.4) is valid
+factorwise at every integer \(t\geq3\).  These statements are frozen
+TOPTAIL (lines 93--174) and TAIL-SPLIT (the charged hsop report, lines
+293--350).
