+\[
+ W_r=a_0C_r^2-b_0B_rC_r+c_0B_r^2                                      \tag{1.6}
+\]
+
+and identifies the support of the relevant Fitting module with
+\(V(I_2(N)+(W_1,\ldots,W_{t-1}))\).  The literal Fitting ideal also contains
