+ d_\Gamma(t)={{3t+1\choose t-1}-{2t\choose t-1}\over t+1},
+\qquad
+2{3t+1\choose t-1}
+=2{2t\choose t-1}+(2t+2)d_\Gamma(t).                                   \tag{1.7}
+\]
